<!--
  RM_DecayDrake.xml — the fermatalis. DONOR_CODE_PLAIN_PORTS_1 (owner pick "port" on
  Transient/donor_code_creatures_sheet_2026-10-09: "Port plain = copy the creature into our own
  defs and drop or swap the donor class (no new C#)").

  Ported from Alpha Animals (sarg.alphaanimals, 1.6/Defs/ThingDefs_Races/Races_DecayDrake.xml).
  Label and description are the owner-ruled fermatalis text (Miasma sheet 2026-10-08: "Rename the
  Fermatalis. Keep the mechanic. Rewrite the description."), the words the campaign's Slime_Rename.xml
  patches onto AA_DecayDrake. One def serves both rosters that cast it (RM_Miasma and RM_Cauldron are
  members of the same composed mod).

  DROPPED (donor assembly AlphaBehavioursAndEvents): CompProperties_GraphicsRefresher and renderTree
  AA_Alternates — an off-by-default alternate-picture switch; nothing in play.
  DROPPED (donor StatDefs): the VEF AnimalStatExtension info-card rows.  NOT ported: donor wildBiomes.
  KEPT ("Keep the mechanic"), guarded on VEF (a framework we keep): the fermenting breath
  (NearbyEffecter: listed grasses and shrubs -> RM_FermentedMound) and eating mounds and liquor
  (EatWeirdFood). Its target lists are the donor's own, string names, copied unchanged — note they
  name vanilla/Alpha Biomes plants, none of the Miasma's own flora, exactly as the donor did.
  The VEF weird-eater think tree is added by Patches/RM_DecayDrake_VEFThinkTree.xml only when VEF's
  ThinkTreeDef exists, so a VEF-less load keeps the vanilla animal think tree.
  SWAPPED for vanilla (donor defs, no code): body AA_WingedQuadrupedAnimalWithPawsAndTail ->
  QuadrupedAnimalWithPawsAndTail (same attack groups); AA_DecayDrake_* sounds -> Pawn_Iguana_*;
  useMeatFrom AA_RoughPlatedMonitor -> Iguana; dessicated art -> Iguana; the mound's taste thought
  AA_AteHorribleRot -> AteRawFood and its art -> vanilla raw fungus tinted mash-brown (placeholder).
  ART: ours, installed through the art ledger at Things/Pawn/Animal/RM_DecayDrake; the donor
  AA_DecayDrake is pointed at the same picture by Patches/ArtFold/DecayDrake_ArtFold.xml.
-->
<Defs>

  <ThingDef ParentName="AnimalThingBase">
    <defName>RM_DecayDrake</defName>
    <label>fermatalis</label>
    <description>A heavy, flightless drake with stunted wings folded over a bloated, sour-sweet belly. The fermatalis breathes out a living haze of yeasts and enzymes that sets almost anything organic around it fermenting, and drives the change at a furious pace: within hours the greenery where it has rested slumps into soft, bubbling mounds of mash. It eats the result and is usually drunk on it — four separate livers keep it alive through the habit. Cooks of the delta count it among the most valuable beasts in the Miasma, for whatever it breathes on ferments in a fraction of the usual time. Hard to tame, but a fermatalis that accepts you, especially if you bring a drink, makes a fine hunting companion.</description>
